            f"[signal_ml] Challenger rejected — OOS AUC {oos_auc:.4f} vs champion "
            f"{_champion_auc:.4f} ({_window_note}) (Δ{_delta:+.4f}, min required +{_MIN_AUC_DELTA_TO_DEPLOY}). "
